From ca28224003b446107fbf5cf582a1d90fcf4f0921 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 07:51:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Batch explicit self-maintenance intake by area and
 UTC day

Route declared Hermes maintenance through one configured intake home; serialize create-or-append and immutable request replay there. Leave ordinary product creation unchanged. Preserve origin adoption and separate execution placement from admission authority.

Proof: main lacks the intake module (5 daily batch regressions fail; 3 product controls pass). Revised batch and CLI/courier tests pass, including concurrent admission, rollback, origin replay, and daily outbound occurrence identity. Full scripts/check passes. State courier route registration and producer enablement require the companion change before rollout.
